OL,3,AFarm defends Titanic-themed ride after
OL,4,Abacklash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of a Titanic-themed ride
OL,7,Fhave defended it after criticism it
OL,8,Fdisrespected those who died in the 1912
OL,9,Fdisaster.
OL,11,FMore than 1,500 people drowned when the
OL,12,Fship struck an iceberg in the North
OL,13,FAtlantic while on its maiden voyage
OL,14,Ffrom Southampton to New York.
OL,16,FThe Titanic ride at Graveley Fruit Farm
OL,17,Fnear Hitchin, Hertfordshire, sees the
OL,18,Freplica ship lift at one end to slide
OL,19,Fcustomers downwards, resembling the
OL,20,Fsinking of the ocean liner.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
